                                "example_id": "4d14242e-7c02-4404-aed8-8a7cdf56f920",
                                "sense_id": "9f0e1b3d-8df0-3ee1-9a58-143518711762",
                                "text": "The bodies which the plague had ſlaine were (O moſt wretched caſe) / Not caried forth to buriall now. For why ſuch ſtore there was / That ſcarce the gates were wyde inough for Coffins forth to paſſe. / So eyther lothly on the ground vnburied did they lie, / Or elſe without ſolemnitie were burnt in bonfires hie / No reuerence nor regard was had."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f44e1d5a-5248-4d99-a9f1-9ee6eb300d13",
                                "sense_id": "9f0e1b3d-8df0-3ee1-9a58-143518711762",
                                "text": "Even the rank poplars bear / Lothly a rival's air."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
